physicalRef: insider_ticketless_grant_counts
description: "Insider threat Link Analysis showcase - one row of counts built by the insider_ticketless_grant_counts Job: grants_without_ticket (landed access grants with no ticket, any system), finance_grants_without_ticket (those to AP, PAYROLL or TREASURY), finance_grantees_without_ticket (employees who received one) and finance_approvers_without_ticket (people who approved one). Read by the Alert Rule insider_finance_grant_without_ticket. Names no employee. Synthetic."
columns[4]{name,type,classification}:
  grants_without_ticket,number,
  finance_grants_without_ticket,number,
  finance_grantees_without_ticket,number,
  finance_approvers_without_ticket,number,
